    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/67b4f5f5-9bc2-4bc2-a174-5554b2ded915-image.png\"/> <br >In tert-butyl cation, carbon bearing <math> <mrow> <mo>⊕</mo> </mrow> </math> charge has one vacant p orbital hence it is <math> <mrow> <mtext>σ</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>p</mtext> </mrow> </math> (empty) conjugation or Hyperconjugation.<br ><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/d0a8a1a7-3820-4a5d-a952-66dfd97625a5-image.png\"/> <br >In 2-butene hyperconjugation between ​<math> <mrow> <mtext>σ</mtext> </mrow> </math> and <math> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>π</mtext> <mo>*</mo> </msup> </mrow> </math> bond.",
